// Contract: --preprocess verilator is debug/inspection only.
// The canonical import path must still use direct Slang import,
// not the _preprocessed.v file.
//
// This test verifies that even with --preprocess verilator, the
// tool uses the direct import path and produces correct IR.
//
// REQUIRES: verilator
// RUN: %hirct-gen --preprocess verilator --no-auto-lib --dump-ir \
// RUN:   %S/Inputs/timescale_mod.v -o %t 2>&1 | %FileCheck %s
//
// The import must succeed via direct path regardless of preprocess mode.
// CHECK: hw.module @timescale_mod
